        fb="👃 Hot water smelling of rotten eggs — but ONLY from the hot taps?\n\nThat's not a gas problem (gas smell is constant and needs 0800 111 999). A smell only in heated water usually points to the hot water cylinder:\n\n🛢️ Stored water sitting too cool — bacteria love a lukewarm tank\n🛢️ A worn sacrificial anode reacting with the water\n🛢️ A cylinder overdue a clean-out\n\nThe fix is usually simple: cylinder up to 60°C, a flush-through, and a check of the immersion thermostat. Cheap, quick, and your morning shower stops smelling like a school science lab.",
