        fb="💨 Black mould creeping into bathroom corners isn't a cleaning problem. It's a moisture problem — and your extractor fan is the first line of defence.\n\nGet the basics right:\n✅ Fan ON during every shower, and 15 minutes after — that's when most of the moisture is still hanging in the air\n✅ Door CLOSED while it runs, so it pulls air out instead of from the hallway\n✅ Mirror still fogged 10 minutes after a shower? The fan is too weak, clogged with dust, or just for show\n\n⚠️ And if damp keeps returning in ONE spot — wall, ceiling, under the floor — rule out a small leak before you blame condensation.",
